@prefix : <http://example.org/> .
# The template's SECOND triple puts `?t` — bound to a triple term — into subject
# position, and §16.2 skips that instantiation instead of erroring. The first
# triple is the control: it consumes the same row, so an empty result would mean
# the WHERE matched nothing rather than that the skip fired.
:r1 :reifies <<( :a :knows :b )>> .
